s":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Third-year student at Houjou High School where she is regarded as an idol by her peers, having been honored with the title of Miss Houjou High for two consecutive years. A talented singer with a bright personality, she has a passion for karaoke and particularly enjoys singing \"White Album\", a song from the first White Album visual novel."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10973"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"峰城大学政経学部3年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"華やかな容姿に似合わず、穏やかで人当たりが良くて控えめという、『ある時期を除いては』ずっと、そんな非の打ち所のない女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今は付属時代よりも目立たないよう周囲に埋没しようとしているが、その、さらに深みを増した美貌や、三年前に作ってしまった“伝説”が、いつまでも彼女をアイドルの地位に縛り続けている。趣味は特になし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼氏の存在——不明。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10392","sourceWorkId":"13255","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"峰城大付属３年Ａ組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミス峰城大付属二年連続制覇中。三連覇の期待がかかる高嶺の花。華やかな容姿に似合わず、穏やかで人当たりが良くて控えめという、非の打ちどころのない女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"…と、周囲に三年間信じ込ませることができるくらいにはいい性格で、その見えない壁を打ち破った者にだけ悪戯っぽく微笑むという。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にもひた隠しにしているが、趣味はヒトカ………カラオケ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"定番のオープニングナンバーは、ちょっと古めの流行歌(WHITE　ALBUM)。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13390"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94bc76bc666b78b9de8cfdfb9bcd3b3178d1127c301c1e032fb6c4dad5ac1f23.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fadf328bd9dc7dd3b0c082649ef84e58951cd41273fc191f3b70904b7e9b4d35.webp","width":110,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"米澤 円","creatorId":"vndb:s189","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s189","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s189","name":"米澤 円","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:62283","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c12973","characterName":"冬馬 かずさ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13391","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"22290"},{"characterId":"13391","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"4066"},{"characterId":"13391","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"54898"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10393"],"vndbCharacterId":"c12973"},"originalCharacterName":"冬馬 かずさ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"528"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Third-year student at Houjou High School who is in the same class as Haruki. While a musical genius, she’s habitually late to school and rarely pays attention during class, resulting in abysmal grades. Combined with her antisocial nature and dismissive attitude toward others, she’s ostracized by classmates and teachers alike."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12973"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"多分ピアニスト。きっとウィーン在住。その他の詳細不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母であり、欧州を中心に世界中で活動するピアニスト冬馬曜子は、たびたび日本のメディアにもその活躍ぶりが紹介されているが、その不良娘にして実績のない若手ピアニストのことは、今現在でも日本ではまったく知られていない。彼女がふたたび日本の地を踏むことは、果たしてあり得るのか…"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10393","sourceWorkId":"13255","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"峰城大付属３年Ｅ組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"窓際の席で常に居眠りしている、遅刻、サボリの常習犯にして、大人はわかってくれない的な鬱屈を抱える、時代錯誤な不良娘。長く艶やかな黒髪、モデル顔負けのスタイル、切れ長の瞳というその孤高で暴力的な性格に似合いすぎる鋭利な美しさのせいで、余計に周囲との距離が広がってしまうという悪循環に陥っているが、本人は何処吹く風で強がっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誰にも聞かれたことはないが、どちらかと言えば緒方理奈派。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13391"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/2786b2c438252659d11afcf